; Outer columns (issue #137): the same 140 px column and the same 180 px gap
; again outboard of each side, so the row of tops runs x=+-710 across the view.
; Still no floor anywhere (just the gap shelves, #1202): every gap is still a committed swing,
; but a player knocked off the end column lands on another top more often.
