; Gap shelves (#1202): 126 falls in 43 rounds, the worst of the 44 stages in the bot sweep. A shelf
; in each of the four 180 px gaps (top y=240, pillar tops y=120) catches a body that slips off a
; pillar top. It lands 120 px below the tops, inside the 100-180 px hook-and-fling the rotation
; already asks of every weapon, and climbs back. The outer ends have no shelf, so a launch off
; the end columns is still a ring-out.
